{{define "main"}}
    {{- /* RG-3: removing a transaction cannot be undone from inside the program,
           so it is asked about rather than done on one press. The whole
           transaction is shown, because "are you sure?" about a row the reader
           cannot see is not a question they can answer. */ -}}
    <div class="register-head">
        <h1>Remove this transaction?</h1>
        <p class="muted">From {{.Account.Name}} &middot; {{.Currency}}</p>
    </div>

    <dl class="txn-facts">
        <dt>Date</dt>
        <dd><code>{{.Date}}</code></dd>
        {{if .CheckNumber}}
            <dt>Num</dt>
            <dd><code>{{.CheckNumber}}</code></dd>
        {{end}}
        <dt>Payee</dt>
        <dd>{{.Payee}}</dd>
        <dt>Category</dt>
        <dd>{{.Category}}</dd>
        {{if .Memo}}
            <dt>Memo</dt>
            <dd>{{.Memo}}</dd>
        {{end}}
        <dt>Amount</dt>
        <dd><code>{{.Amount}} {{.Currency}}</code></dd>
        <dt>Status</dt>
        <dd>{{.StatusLabel}}</dd>
    </dl>

    <p>
        The transaction is removed from the register and the balances are recomputed without it.
        {{if .IsSplit}}
            The {{.SplitCount}} parts it was divided among go with it. The categories themselves
            are not touched, and neither is anything else in the checkbook.
        {{else}}
            The category it was filed under is not touched, and neither is anything else in the
            checkbook.
        {{end}}
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
        Nothing in the program undoes this. Your backups still hold the transaction, so a copy
        taken before now is the way back; if you have not taken one recently, press <em>Back up
        now</em> first.
    </p>

    <form method="post" action="/accounts/{{.Account.ID}}/transactions/{{.ID}}/delete">
        {{- /* The version this page was drawn for. If another window changed the
               transaction while this page sat open, it is no longer the one that
               was confirmed, and the removal is refused rather than applied to
               something the reader was not shown (CO-3). */ -}}
        <input type="hidden" name="updated_at" value="{{.Token}}">
        <div class="entry-fields">
            <div class="f-add"><button type="submit" class="danger">Remove transaction</button></div>
            <div class="f-add"><a class="cta" href="/accounts/{{.Account.ID}}#txn-{{.ID}}">Keep it</a></div>
        </div>
    </form>
{{end}}
